  "worked_solution": "We see that the point $(3,5)$ lies on the graph. Let's write the ratio $3:5$ as a fraction:\n\n$$\n\\frac{3}{5}\n$$\n\nWe can not simplify this fraction further. Hence, we can say that the graph shows the ratio $\\frac{3}{5}.$",
